{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2021-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1637020800, "end_date": 1637625599, "month_true_total": 122, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:14:30 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "103226734", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056045835", "personaname": "EVIL SKETTI", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/hun2r/", "num_games_owned": 524, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 358, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 358, "last_played": 1637518601, "avatar": "6e523a7747de2bc72c3b414aa39345287c1c1a0f"}, "language": "english", "review": "underrated classic would be an understatement, overshadowed by gears of war this aged like the finest wine and stood the test of time to be one of the best third person shooters in the genre. relic make another sequel you ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ wizards, for the empire and sidonus!", "timestamp_created": 1637518805, "timestamp_updated": 1637518805, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 49, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.775185346603393555", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103157891", "author": {"steamid": "76561198304706399", "personaname": "Wazza", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198304706399/", "num_games_owned": 228, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 437, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 437, "last_played": 1637436070, "avatar": "5538d83e48fbb41dc72d77abceda0969bca79206"}, "language": "english", "review": "the campaign was good, kinda sad i didn't get to see any tech priest but it is what it is, Ultramarines have plot armor but it's not really a negative point, the combat was pretty good and changing weapons during combat was pretty smooth, the progression of the equipment felt pretty nice. The fact that the screen shakes after each step of the space marine wasn't disrupting at all and just added to that feeling of being a human tank. I liked that. The only negative thing i could find is the fact that you can't skip cutscenes so when you die (for my part during the last battle) it was sort of annoying to have to watch the cutscene like 4 times. Overall pretty good game and the lifespan of it is alright for it's cost as a key (can't speak of the actual steam price) I recommend for beginners in the 40k universe as well as people who know maybe a bit too much about the lore. gg", "timestamp_created": 1637436554, "timestamp_updated": 1637436554, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103115082", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017964777", "personaname": "Alpha Papa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017964777/", "num_games_owned": 112, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 449, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 335, "last_played": 1764621267, "avatar": "5076cb4b31180b9fb9b6520693e7906f4c89b8ba"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great Warhammer 40000 game", "timestamp_created": 1637393259, "timestamp_updated": 1637393259, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519999980926513672", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "103097811", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970970621", "personaname": "Elviis", "persona_status": "